If your API uses PascalCase

Based on your sample response and ASP.NET Core JSON configuration, if the JSON property is actually:

{
    "RBListOfBuses": "Ford F-150, Ford F-250"
}

then the above is correct:

costData.RBListOfBuses

If your API is configured for camelCase and returns:

{
    "rbListOfBuses": "Ford F-150, Ford F-250"
}

then use:

$('#rbListOfBuses').text(costData.rbListOfBuses || '-');
